ime horizon of 1 month – 1 year. Users who stake OGN receive xOGN relative to the amount staked and the duration of the lock-up period. xOGN grants holders economic and voting rights during the staking period.\n\nRewards: Origin takes a performance fee from its yield generating products. Half of this fee is distributed to OGN stakers in the form of extra rewards, while the remaining 50% funds the purchase of flywheel tokens to boost yield generated by the underlying protocols.\n\nGovernance: OGN stakers comprise the Origin DAO, which votes on proposals and treasury allocations. Origin promotes fully on-chain governance to cultivate a sustainable, inclusive structure."}, "links": {"homepage": ["http://www.originprotocol.com"], "whitepaper": "https://www.originprotocol.com/en/whitepaper", "blockchain_site": ["https://etherscan.io/token/0x8207c1ffc5b6804f6024322ccf34f29c3541ae26", "https://intel.arkm.com/explorer/token/origin-protocol", "https://ethplorer.io/address/0x8207c1ffc5b6804f6024322ccf34f29c3541ae26", "https://basescan.org/token/0x7002458b1df59eccb57387bc79ffc7c29e22e6f7", "https://explorer.energi.network/token/0x1e3eed9c1eba5e5114d4c185dc71d13c3c66dd84", "https://sonicscan.org/token/0x61647882acf21792e577a963d320d51e2c8f6194"], "official_forum_url": [], "chat_url": ["https://discordapp.com/invite/jyxpUSe", "https://www.facebook.com/originprotocol/"], "announcement_url": [], "snapshot_url": "https://snapshot.org/#/origingov.eth", "twitter_screen_name": "OriginProtocol", "facebook_username": "originprotocol", "bitcointalk_thread_identifier": 2711791, "telegram_channel_identifier": "originprotocol", "subreddit_url": "https://www.reddit.com/r/originprotocol", "repos_url": {"github": ["https://github.com/OriginProtocol/origin", "https://github.com/OriginProtocol/dshop", "https://github.com/OriginProtocol/origin-dollar"], "bitbucket": []}}, "image": {"thumb": "https://coin-images.coingecko.com/coins/images/3296/thumb/op.jpg?1696504006", "small": "https://coin-image